  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
  padding:0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt'>
  <p style='margin-top:6.0pt'>The following carcinogens or the mixtures
  containing the following carcinogens at concentrations above 5% by weight:
  4-Aminobiphenyl and/or its salts, Benzotrichloride, Benzidine and/or salts,
  Bis (chloromethyl) ether, Chloromethyl methyl ether, 1,2-Dibromometan,
  Diethyl sulfate, Dimethyl sulfate, Dimetylcarbamoyl chloride,
  1,2-Dibrom-3-chloropropane, 1,2-Dimethyl hydrazin, Dimethylnitrosamine,
  Hexamethylphosphoric triamide, hydrazine, 2-Naphtylamine and/or salts,
  4-Nitrodiphenyl and 1,3 Propanesultone</p>
  </td>
  <td width="25%" style='width:25.2%;border-top:none;border-left:none;
  border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
  padding:0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt'>
  <p style='margin-top:6.0pt'>Các chất có khả năng gây ung thư hoặc các hỗn hợp
  chứa các chất có khả năng gây ung thư thành phần khối lượng trên 5%:
  4-Aminobiphenyl và/hoặc muối của nó, Benzotriclorid, Benzidin và/hoặc các muối,
  Bis (clorometyl) ete, Clometyl metyl ete, 1,2-Dibrometan, Dietyl sunphat,
  Dimetyl sunphat, Dimetylcacbamoyl clorit, 1,2-Dibrom-3-clo propan,
  1,2-Dimetylhydrazin, Dimetylnitro amin, Hexametylphotphoric triamit,
  Hydrazin, 2-Naphtylamin và/hoặc muối của 4-Nitrodiphenyl và 1,3
  -Propanesulton</p>
  </td>
  <td width="9%" style='width:9.04%;border-top:none;border-left:none;
  border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
  padding:0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt'>
  <p align=center style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-align:center'>---</p>
  </td>
  <td width="19%" style='width:19.1%;border-top:none;border-left:none;
  border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
  padding:0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt'>
  <p align=center style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-align:center'>---</p>
  </td>
  <td width="11%" style='width:11.94%;border-top:none;border-left:none;
  border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
  padding:0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt'>
  <p align=center style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-align:center'>500</p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

